Current for lakeS >= 0:
```js
const shelf = smoothstep(0, 7, lakeS);
const deep = smoothstep(8, 28, lakeS);
let depth = 1 + 2.4 * shelf + 6.4 * deep;
const rough = (fbm2(x*0.055, z*0.055, 2, seed+91) - 0.5) * 4.6;   // ±2.3
depth += bankNoise * 2.6 * smoothstep(3, 12, lakeS);   // bankNoise ±1 → ±2.6
